[1.168285, "o", "\u001b[2m│  H100 · 80 GB HBM3 · ~700 W · 3.35 TB/s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.27343, "o", "│  weights: \u001b[35m8B × 2 bytes\u001b[0m = 14.9 GiB resident, \u001b[2mloaded once at boot. never reload.\u001b[0m\r\n│  KV cache pool: \u001b[33m24.4 GiB\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(128 KiB/token × 200k)\u001b[0m — the context window IS spare VRAM.\r\n"]
