[2.698188, "o", "│  a nested for-loop: K-loop inside, grid outside. the K-loop exits. the\r\n│  outer one was never given an exit. \u001b[2m~40 launches/token, forever.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L8 · TENSOR CORE — 2 billion ticks/second of pure obedience \u001b[2m───────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  132 SMs · HMMA.m16n8k16 = 4,096 FLOP/issue\u001b[0m\r\n"]
