[3.814978, "o", "│  \u001b[33mthe die produced ~16.2 GFLOP of flawless, useless math.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  nothing above the MMA knows it's wasted. nothing below knows there was a question.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L9 · THE NUMBER — one weight, literally \u001b[2m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  fp16 · zoom: 16 bits\u001b[0m\r\n"]
