[11.577199, "o", "\r                                                                                \r│  \u001b[33mtotal zoom: ×10³³. physics verified at every stop — then the road ends,\r\n"]
[11.577414, "o", "│  \u001b[33mnot with a thing, but with the end of the CONCEPT of size.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L21 · THE EDGE — here be dragons \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  the honest inventory of what 'deeper' cannot currently answer\u001b[0m\r\n│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mno verified theory. strings: 10 extra dims, unproven. LQG: quantized space, unproven.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.657502, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? vacuum catastrophe\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mQFT predicts empty-space energy 10¹²⁰× observed — worst miss in physics. machine works anyway.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.732954, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? dark sector\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.733202, "o", "│    \u001b[2m~95% of the universe (dark energy ~68% + dark matter ~27%) unmeasured. we are the minority.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.809417, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? measurement problem\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mL19. unsolved since 1927 — the longest-running spiral in science.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.889579, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? holography / it-from-bit\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mreal math (AdS/CFT): a volume fully encoded on its boundary. proven in toy universes only.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.966302, "o", "│  every previous level answered. this one refuses. the bottom of 'as deep as\r\n│  we can' is a boundary of knowledge, drawn in 10⁻³⁵ m ink.\r\n"]
[11.966461, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L22 · BELOW THE WALL — the map of the unverified \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  the last floor: not a place — a stack of hypotheses with no floor yet\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.096539, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ string theory\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2meverything = 1D filaments ~10⁻³⁵ m, modes = particles. needs 10 spatial dimensions. no unique experimental test to date. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.189174, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ loop quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mspace and time themselves quantized; smallest volume ~4×10⁻¹⁰⁵ m³. no confirmed prediction. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.280684, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ causal set theory\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mspacetime grows from a discrete partial order of events — 'before' is the only primitive. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.373337, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ the holographic principle\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2m3D reality fully encoded on a 2D boundary. exact for some toy universes (AdS/CFT); ours: UNKNOWN.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.46601, "o", "\r\n│  \u001b[1mthis is maximum depth. not because we stopped digging — because the\r\n"]
[12.466249, "o", "│  shovel is made of the thing we're digging in.\u001b[0m below the wall there is no\r\n│  'below'. there are proposals, beautifully drawn, none with a floor of their own.\r\n│  \u001b[31mdeepest we can go = a well-posed map of what we cannot reach.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  FINAL REPORT — THE COMPLETE DESCENT · L0 → L22 · MAXIMUM DEPTH REACHED\r\n  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  runtime             : 0:00:11\r\n  tokens generated    : 146 (answer produced: \u001b[31mNO\u001b[0m) · switch-cycles: 66\r\n  zoom                : ×10³³ — from keycap to the planck wall\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mthe ladder:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36"]
[12.466318, "o", "mL0  \u001b[0m \u001b[34m10² m   \u001b[0m wire              \u001b[2mrequest crosses the internet\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL1  \u001b[0m —        tokenizer         \u001b[2mtext becomes token IDs\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL2  \u001b[0m \u001b[34m10⁻¹ m  \u001b[0m gpu               \u001b[2mweights + KV cache resident in VRAM\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL3  \u001b[0m —        forward pass      \u001b[2mqkv · attn · mlp · logits\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL4  \u001b[0m —        decode loop       \u001b[2mautoregression with no exit condition\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL5  \u001b[0m \u001b[34m10² m   \u001b[0m wire back         \u001b[2mSSE holds; client waits forever\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL6  \u001b[0m —        orchestrator      \u001b[2mscheduler calls generate() endlessly\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.46635, "o", "    \u001b[36mL7  \u001b[0m \u001b[34m10⁻² m  \u001b[0m cuda kernel       \u001b[2mnested for-loops, no sentinel\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL8  \u001b[0m \u001b[34m10⁻³ m  \u001b[0m tensor core       \u001b[2mMMAs recompute the same distribution\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL9  \u001b[0m —        fp16 number       \u001b[2mread 0xB800. multiply. repeat.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL10 \u001b[0m —        memory hierarchy  \u001b[2m14.9 GiB re-read per token\u001b[0m\r\n"]
