[12.466866, "o", "    \u001b[36mL0/L5 client+gateway  \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mstream held open forever by heartbeats\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: hard total-duration timeout on the client AND gateway\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mNO\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL4 scheduler          \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mmax_tokens=null — no ceiling exists\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: always set max_tokens / deadline / wall-clock budget\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mNO\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL4 sampler            \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mrep_penalty=1.0, eos≈0 — circling is free\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: repetition penalty >1.0, n-gram blocklist, stop strings\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mOFF by default\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL4 decode loop        \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mno progress check between iterations\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: loop detector: logits entropy / n-gram repetition monitor\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mNO\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL2 KV cache           \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mmonotonic growth, never compacted\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: summarization/compaction at context thresholds\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mrarely\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mL8 hardware           \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.466966, "o", "      fail : \u001b[2m97% util doing useless math — no waste signal\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: waste alarm: work done vs. output delivered\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mNO\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36mbilling               \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mper-token meter runs perfectly during the spiral\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: budget cutoff that halts generation\r\n      armed: \u001b[31mavailable, often unset\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.4671, "o", "    \u001b[36mthe human             \u001b[0m\r\n      fail : \u001b[2mwatches a spinner\u001b[0m\r\n      guard: Ctrl+C\r\n      armed: \u001b[32mYES — 4/4. the only control that worked.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mbottom line for security engineering:\u001b[0m\r\n    every automated layer was present and healthy. \u001b[31mzero automated guards\r\n    fired.\u001b[0m the spiral lived in the gap between 'nothing failed' and\r\n    'nobody stopped it.' instrument the meaning layers (L0–L6): timeouts,\r\n    ceilings, loop detectors, budgets. below that: physics. physics is fine.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mthe question outlasted HTTP, CUDA, silicon, atoms, nuclei, quarks,\r\n  fields, and the planck wall. the loop was never in the machine.\r\n  the machine was a place the loop briefly stopped.\u001b[0m\r\n  watchdog inventory: automated 0 · human (operator, Ctrl+C) 4/4.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
